{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Another Series on Searches, Etc.","html":"<article id='sn46.165-174'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.165–174 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 46.165–174 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>17. Punaesanāvagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>17. Another Chapter on Searches </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Punaesanādisutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Another Series on Searches, Etc. </span></h1></header>\n<p class='expansion-instructions'><span class='root'>…pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>(Tell in full as in SN 45.161–170.)</span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Punaesanāvaggo sattarasamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Uddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Esanā vidhā āsavo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bhavo ca dukkhatā tisso; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Khilaṁ malañca nīgho ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vedanātaṇhā tasināya cāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
